/** @page about About ParaMagneticS
  @section overview Parallel magnetic field and force simulation
  ParaMagneticS models permanent magnets using analytic and faceted field
  kernels. It supports JSON scenes, parametrized arrangements, force and torque
  integration, Halbach homogeneity optimization, and a Qt viewer.

  @section architecture Library interfaces
  The public C++ namespace is greeter and the installed CMake target is
  Greeter::Greeter. SimulationService supplies field and force results through
  the view data structures without exposing Kokkos types to viewer code.
  HalbachOptimizer precomputes candidate fields, searches over ring choices,
  and verifies the assembled result on full-volume grids.

  @section execution Host execution and accuracy
  Select AUTO, OpenMP, or Serial with PARAMAGNETICS_BACKEND. Field kernels and
  stored samples use single precision, with double precision accumulation.
  Verification compares finer and shifted grids; this tests sampling sensitivity
  and does not replace independent physics validation.
*/
